From 5f9d2a49b821a10f697741993b183313ff7b4820 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:08:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Send a replaced investigator's open desk to the hub

A rejoin from another device retired the player's investigator but
told nobody, so a desk still open on it stayed live with the used
invite banner (issue #39). The rejoin now sends investigator_replaced
to the key of each investigator it retires; the desk goes to the hub
with "<new> joined <campaign> in place of <old>.", clears the invite,
drops it as Last Played and closes its socket. WEBSOCKET.md, ROUTES.md
and QUIRKS.md describe it.

Checked with a new test in test_rest_broadcasts.py (failing before),
test_rest_broadcasts and test_campaigns passing, and in Chromium at
390x844, 820x1180 and 1366x768: invite banner on the desk, rejoin over
the API, the desk lands on the hub with the notice and no banner.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
